# Custom Styles and Scripts

Custom stylesheets (CSS, SCSS) and JavaScript files for the theme are primarily located within the [assets/](mdc:assets) directory.

*   **CSS/SCSS**: Look for `.css`, `.scss`, or `.scss.liquid` files in `assets/`. These files define the visual styling of the theme.
*   **JavaScript**: Look for `.js` files in `assets/`. These files add an interactive functionality to the theme.

Compiled versions of these assets (e.g., minified CSS and JS) are also typically stored in the `assets/` directory and referenced in `layout/theme.liquid` or other relevant Liquid files.
